
# Domain the shared light/dark theme cookie is written for. Set it to the registrable parent domain the
# platform's apps live under (e.g. .shadow-apps.com) so a theme picked in one app is the theme every other
# app opens with. Leave it unset in development: the local apps differ only by port, which a cookie's scope
# already ignores.
VITE_THEME_COOKIE_DOMAIN=

# Where the "Write a novel" links send readers. Novel Forge is a separate first-party deployment, so its
# host changes per environment (e.g. https://novel-forge.shadow-apps.test in the dev cluster). Left unset,
# it falls back to production, https://novel-forge.shadow-apps.com.
VITE_NOVEL_FORGE_URL=
